cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "fitslog: turn a folder tree of FITS files into one night-log CSV, with an audit of problem files"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/fitslog"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/fitslog"
abstract: >-
  Scans a folder tree of telescope FITS files (headers only) and writes
  one night-log CSV with header keywords normalised across instruments,
  plus an audit flagging corrupt files, missing fields, duplicated
  keywords and headers with no WCS.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - FITS
  - night log
  - header audit
